sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(OpenAI/Anthropic SDK)
    participant Proxy as Praxis AI Proxy<br/>8080/TCP
    participant Classifier as Request Classifier
    participant Filters as Filter Pipeline
    participant Backend as Inference Backend<br/>(vLLM)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant Guardrails as NeMo Guardrails

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,PG: Flow 1: OpenAI Responses Request Through Translation
        Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/responses<br/>HTTPS/TLS, Bearer Token
        Proxy->>Classifier: Classify request<br/>(provider, model, protocol)
        Classifier->>Filters: OpenAI Responses detected
        Filters->>Filters: responses_to_chat_completions<br/>(protocol translation)
        Filters->>Backend: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Bearer (credential_inject)
        Backend-->>Filters: SSE stream response
        Filters->>PG: Persist response state<br/>PostgreSQL/TLS, Password/mTLS
        PG-->>Filters: Stored
        Filters-->>Client: SSE stream<br/>(translated back to Responses format)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Client,MCP: Flow 2: Agentic Tool Loop (MCP)
        Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/responses (with tools)<br/>HTTPS/TLS, Bearer
        Proxy->>Filters: openai_mcp_tool_resolve
        Filters->>MCP: GET tools/list<br/>HTTP/HTTPS/TLS, Bearer
        MCP-->>Filters: Available tools
        loop Agentic Loop (per iteration)
            Filters->>Backend: Inference request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS/TLS, Bearer
            Backend-->>Filters: Tool call response
            Filters->>MCP: POST tools/call<br/>HTTP/HTTPS/TLS, Bearer
            MCP-->>Filters: Tool result
        end
        Filters-->>Client: Final response
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Client,Backend: Flow 3: Anthropic Messages Translation
        Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/messages<br/>HTTPS/TLS, x-api-key
        Proxy->>Classifier: Classify as Anthropic Messages
        Classifier->>Filters: anthropic_messages_to_chat_completions
        Filters->>Backend: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS/TLS, Bearer
        Backend-->>Filters: SSE stream
        Filters-->>Client: Anthropic Messages SSE stream<br/>(translated response)
    end
